{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.98,"lines":[{"text":"Charles le bon on the beat","t":2.26,"e":3.62,"w":[["Charles",2.26,2.6],["le",2.6,2.68],["bon",2.78,3],["on",3,3.06],["the",3.12,3.2],["beat",3.26,3.62]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mmm-mmm, mmm... hmm-hmm","t":6.1,"e":14.24,"w":[["Mmm-mmm",6.1,6.26],["mmm",6.26,6.3],["hmm-hmm",14.14,14.24]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"On trinque au champagne, debout sur les ruines","t":14.28,"e":16.14,"w":[["On",14.28,14.36],["trinque",14.4,14.58],["au",14.62,14.66],["champagne",14.7,15.16],["debout",15.2,15.46],["sur",15.52,15.62],["les",15.64,15.74],["ruines",15.84,16.14]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le monde s'effondre mais le filtre illumine","t":17.96,"e":19.78,"w":[["Le",17.96,18.04],["monde",18.12,18.34],["s'effondre",18.4,18.7],["mais",18.74,18.84],["le",18.88,18.96],["filtre",19.02,19.22],["illumine",19.28,19.78]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ils vendent leur âme, paiement en trois fois","t":21.68,"e":23.48,"w":[["Ils",21.68,21.76],["vendent",21.8,21.98],["leur",22.02,22.26],["âme",22.36,22.52],["paiement",22.56,22.86],["en",22.9,22.96],["trois",23,23.18],["fois",23.24,23.48]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Sans frais, sans remords, sans même un émoi","t":23.84,"e":26.26,"w":[["Sans",23.84,24.04],["frais",24.1,24.3],["sans",24.56,24.7],["remords",24.76,25.28],["sans",25.34,25.44],["même",25.5,25.66],["un",25.7,25.8],["émoi",25.88,26.26]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Diogène cherchait un homme, lanterne en plein jour","t":28.24,"e":30.58,"w":[["Diogène",28.24,28.66],["cherchait",28.7,29.04],["un",29.08,29.2],["homme",29.24,29.44],["lanterne",29.7,29.94],["en",29.98,30.06],["plein",30.1,30.26],["jour",30.32,30.58]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Moi j'cherche du réseau au milieu des vautours","t":31.76,"e":34.24,"w":[["Moi",31.76,31.86],["j'cherche",31.88,32.08],["du",32.12,32.2],["réseau",32.26,32.84],["au",32.92,32.98],["milieu",33.06,33.46],["des",33.54,33.74],["vautours",33.8,34.24]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Sisyphe pousse son rocher, on le filme, on rigole","t":34.79,"e":37,"w":[["Sisyphe",34.79,34.99],["pousse",35.34,35.48],["son",35.5,35.62],["rocher",35.66,35.82],["on",35.84,35.92],["le",35.96,36.04],["filme",36.1,36.28],["on",36.3,36.38],["rigole",36.44,37]],"ok":0.89},{"text":"Sa peine fait des vues, sa sueur des symboles","t":37.78,"e":40.7,"w":[["Sa",37.78,37.9],["peine",37.94,38.08],["fait",38.14,38.22],["des",38.26,38.4],["vues",38.46,38.78],["sa",39.48,39.58],["sueur",39.64,39.9],["des",39.94,40.04],["symboles",40.1,40.7]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le rire est jaune, le ciel est noir","t":41.96,"e":43.8,"w":[["Le",41.96,42.04],["rire",42.12,42.3],["est",42.34,42.52],["jaune",42.58,42.84],["le",42.88,42.96],["ciel",43.02,43.22],["est",43.28,43.44],["noir",43.52,43.8]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"On danse quand même, faut bien y croire","t":45.66,"e":47.48,"w":[["On",45.66,45.74],["danse",45.8,45.94],["quand",45.98,46.22],["même",46.28,46.48],["faut",46.56,46.66],["bien",46.72,46.9],["y",46.94,47.1],["croire",47.16,47.48]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mmm-mmm... tout brille, tout brûle","t":49.08,"e":50.26,"w":[["Mmm-mmm",49.08,49.18],["tout",49.22,49.42],["brille",49.48,49.62],["tout",49.68,49.9],["brûle",49.94,50.26]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mmm-mmm... ça va aller","t":50.62,"e":52.08,"w":[["Mmm-mmm",50.62,50.98],["ça",51.06,51.28],["va",51.32,51.46],["aller",51.7,52.08]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mmm-mmm... le toit s'écroule","t":52.76,"e":53.94,"w":[["Mmm-mmm",52.76,52.86],["le",52.92,53.12],["toit",53.16,53.3],["s'écroule",53.38,53.94]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mmm-mmm... ça va aller","t":54.7,"e":55.58,"w":[["Mmm-mmm",54.7,54.7],["ça",54.76,54.96],["va",55.04,55.18],["aller",55.4,55.58]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"On a tout perdu sauf le sourire","t":55.68,"e":57.62,"w":[["On",55.68,55.78],["a",55.84,55.92],["tout",55.96,56.1],["perdu",56.16,56.54],["sauf",56.6,56.84],["le",56.88,56.98],["sourire",57.06,57.62]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ça va aller, ça va aller","t":57.8,"e":59.28,"w":[["Ça",57.8,57.92],["va",57.96,58.08],["aller",58.18,58.4],["ça",58.48,58.66],["va",58.74,58.86],["aller",58.98,59.28]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le pire est passé, reste le pire","t":59.34,"e":61.4,"w":[["Le",59.34,59.44],["pire",59.5,59.66],["est",59.68,59.78],["passé",59.84,60.22],["reste",60.3,60.68],["le",60.74,60.94],["pire",61.04,61.4]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ça va aller... mmm-mmm","t":61.5,"e":76.08,"w":[["Ça",61.5,61.62],["va",61.64,61.78],["aller",61.86,62.24],["mmm-mmm",76,76.08]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"J'ai lu Nietzsche à l'envers : ce qui m'tue pas me fatigue","t":76.56,"e":78.88,"w":[["J'ai",76.56,76.7],["lu",76.76,76.84],["Nietzsche",76.9,77.1],["à",77.14,77.16],["l'envers",77.22,77.46],["ce",77.52,77.72],["qui",77.58,77.78],["m'tue",77.64,77.74],["pas",77.98,78.08],["me",78.14,78.24],["fatigue",78.32,78.88]],"ok":0.82},{"text":"J'ai fixé l'abîme, c'est lui qui cligne, lui qui abdique","t":79.32,"e":82.6,"w":[["J'ai",79.32,79.44],["fixé",79.5,79.76],["l'abîme",79.82,80.22],["c'est",80.28,80.38],["lui",80.44,80.56],["qui",80.62,80.76],["cligne",80.88,81.44],["lui",81.54,81.74],["qui",81.82,81.98],["abdique",82.1,82.6]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Les rois sont nus, la cour applaudit la couture","t":83.04,"e":86.28,"w":[["Les",83.04,83.14],["rois",83.18,83.32],["sont",83.38,83.6],["nus",83.7,83.94],["la",84.6,84.68],["cour",84.74,84.86],["applaudit",84.94,85.46],["la",85.54,85.64],["couture",85.68,86.28]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"On maquille le cadavre, on l'appelle « la culture »","t":86.3,"e":89.8,"w":[["On",86.3,86.38],["maquille",86.44,86.86],["le",86.92,87.02],["cadavre",87.08,87.98],["on",88.46,88.54],["l'appelle",88.58,89.16],["la",89.22,89.32],["culture",89.38,89.8]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"L'amertume je la bois sans sucre, café noir de veille","t":89.84,"e":93.18,"w":[["L'amertume",89.84,90.24],["je",90.3,90.38],["la",90.44,90.52],["bois",90.6,90.72],["sans",90.78,90.98],["sucre",91.06,91.3],["café",92.3,92.54],["noir",92.6,92.7],["de",92.76,92.86],["veille",92.92,93.18]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ils ont le cœur en solde et l'ego qui s'émerveille","t":93.24,"e":95.96,"w":[["Ils",93.24,93.36],["ont",93.38,93.48],["le",93.54,93.74],["cœur",93.82,94],["en",94.06,94.2],["solde",94.28,94.46],["et",94.48,94.56],["l'ego",94.6,94.98],["qui",95.04,95.14],["s'émerveille",95.2,95.96]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Sénèque disait « la vie est courte », eux font la file d'attente","t":96.3,"e":99.16,"w":[["Sénèque",96.3,96.56],["disait",96.62,97],["la",97.06,97.18],["vie",97.22,97.34],["est",97.36,97.48],["courte",97.54,97.92],["eux",98,98.1],["font",98.14,98.24],["la",98.28,98.38],["file",98.44,98.58],["d'attente",98.62,99.16]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Pour un trône en carton sur une terre en pente","t":100,"e":103,"w":[["Pour",100,100.1],["un",100.16,100.22],["trône",100.28,100.42],["en",100.46,100.54],["carton",100.58,101.02],["sur",101.68,101.84],["une",101.92,102.08],["terre",102.14,102.32],["en",102.38,102.54],["pente",102.6,103]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mmm-mmm... tout brille, tout brûle","t":104.48,"e":105.68,"w":[["Mmm-mmm",104.48,104.58],["tout",104.62,104.82],["brille",104.88,105.04],["tout",105.1,105.28],["brûle",105.36,105.68]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mmm-mmm... ça va aller","t":106.28,"e":107.48,"w":[["Mmm-mmm",106.28,106.4],["ça",106.48,106.68],["va",106.76,106.84],["aller",107.14,107.48]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mmm-mmm... le toit s'écroule","t":108.16,"e":109.48,"w":[["Mmm-mmm",108.16,108.26],["le",108.3,108.5],["toit",108.58,108.7],["s'écroule",108.78,109.48]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mmm-mmm... ça va aller","t":110.08,"e":111.04,"w":[["Mmm-mmm",110.08,110.1],["ça",110.16,110.36],["va",110.4,110.46],["aller",110.84,111.04]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"On a tout perdu sauf le sourire","t":111.12,"e":113.12,"w":[["On",111.12,111.2],["a",111.24,111.32],["tout",111.36,111.5],["perdu",111.56,111.94],["sauf",112.02,112.26],["le",112.3,112.38],["sourire",112.48,113.12]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ça va aller, ça va aller","t":113.2,"e":114.7,"w":[["Ça",113.2,113.32],["va",113.36,113.46],["aller",113.58,113.78],["ça",113.86,114.06],["va",114.12,114.2],["aller",114.52,114.7]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Le pir